=== the five measurements ===
# THE EDGE HELD A COPY WITH A TTL STILL TO RUN (bounded by max-age=60 in
# scripts/publish-status.sh, plus one 2 s sampling interval and a revalidation):
#   stage nodes-apply   deleted 05:28:20.578 -> 403 at 05:29:18.185     57.6 s
#   prod  nodes-apply   deleted 05:53:25.801 -> 403 at 05:54:26.893     61.1 s
#
# THE EDGE HELD NOTHING OR AN ERROR, so it went to the origin during the request.
# Written-at from `aws s3api head-object`, except prod's which is the document's
# own `written_at` and is therefore an upper bound on the write:
#   stage nodes-apply   written 05:46:34    -> 200 at 05:46:34.113    <= 1.1 s
#   status/stage.json   written 05:46:35    -> 200 at 05:46:36.585    <= 1.6 s
#   prod  nodes-apply   written 06:11:43    -> 200 at 06:11:51.625    <= 8.6 s
#
# 403 rather than 404 for an absent key: the bucket is private behind OAC without
# s3:ListBucket. The page's predicate is `r.ok`, so both reach the same branch.
